  "header": "VEHICLE TRADE-IN AGREEMENT",
  "footer_page_numbers": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VEHICLE TRADE-IN AGREEMENT",
      "level": 1,
      "style": "CT"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Vehicle Trade-In Agreement (\"Trade-In Agreement\") is made as of {{trade_in_date}} between:",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "{{dealership_name}}, located at {{dealership_address}} (\"Dealer\")",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "{{trade_in_owner_name}}, located at {{trade_in_owner_address}} (\"Trade-In Owner\")",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "1. TRADE-IN VEHICLE",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Field",
        "Details"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Make",
          "{{trade_in_make}}"
        ],
        [
          "Model",
          "{{trade_in_model}}"
        ],
        [
          "Year",
          "{{trade_in_year}}"
        ],
        [
          "VIN",
          "{{trade_in_vin}}"
        ],
        [
          "Odometer",
          "{{trade_in_odometer}} miles"
        ],
        [
          "Color",
          "{{trade_in_color}}"
        ],
        [
          "Title Number",
          "{{trade_in_title_number}}"
        ],
        [
          "Current License Plate",
          "{{trade_in_plate}}"
        ],
        [
          "Condition",
          "{{trade_in_condition}} (Excellent / Good / Fair / Poor)"
        ],
        [
          "Known Damage / Defects",
          "{{trade_in_damage}}"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "2. TRADE-IN ALLOWANCE",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "",
        "Item",
        "Amount / Details"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Trade-In Allowance (credit toward purchase)",
          "{{trade_in_allowance}}",
          "Applied as credit at purchase closing."
        ],
        [
          "Allowance Basis",
          "{{allowance_basis}}",
          "Fair market value / Offered value / Net value after reconditioning."
        ],
        [
          "Reconditioning / Processing Fee",
          "{{reconditioning_fee}}",
          "Deducted from allowance if applicable."
        ],
        [
          "Net Trade-In Credit",
          "{{net_trade_in_credit}}",
          "Amount actually applied to new vehicle purchase."
        ],
        [
          "Refund Due to Trade-In Owner (if allowance > purchase price)",
          "{{trade_in_refund}}",
          "Paid by {{refund_method}} on {{refund_date}}."
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "3. TRADE-IN OWNER REPRESENTATIONS",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Trade-In Owner is the legal owner of the Trade-In Vehicle and has full authority to trade it in.",
        "The Trade-In Vehicle is free of all liens and encumbrances, except as disclosed.",
        "Trade-In Owner will deliver a valid, properly assigned title to Dealer at closing.",
        "Trade-In Owner has not previously sold, offered to sell, or contracted to sell the Trade-In Vehicle to any other person.",
        "Trade-In Owner has disclosed all known material defects to Dealer.",
        "Trade-In Vehicle has not been declared a total loss, salvaged, reconstructed, or flood-damaged (unless disclosed).",
        "{{trade_in_owner_reps}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "4. CONDITION AND \"AS-IS\"",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Trade-In Vehicle is accepted by Dealer \"as-is\" with no warranties from Trade-In Owner, except as stated in writing. Dealer may inspect and adjust the allowance based on inspection results.",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "5. TITLE TRANSFER",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Trade-In Owner will deliver the Trade-In Vehicle and its title to Dealer on or before {{title_delivery_date}}. Dealer will handle DMV transfer paperwork. Title transfer to Dealer is a condition of the allowance.",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "6. RELATIONSHIP TO PURCHASE AGREEMENT",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Trade-In Agreement is part of and subject to the Vehicle Purchase Agreement dated {{purchase_agreement_date}} between Trade-In Owner (as Buyer) and Dealer (for the new vehicle). The trade-in allowance is contingent on the successful closing of the Purchase Agreement.",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "7. CANCELLATION",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "If the Purchase Agreement is cancelled or not consummated, this Trade-In Agreement is void. Trade-In Owner may reclaim the Trade-In Vehicle in its current condition, and any allowance offered is withdrawn.",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "SIGNATURES",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "",
        "Dealer",
        "Trade-In Owner"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Signature",
          "_____________________________",
          "_____________________________"
        ],
        [
          "Printed Name",
          "{{dealership_name}}",
          "{{trade_in_owner_name}}"
        ],
        [
          "Date",
          "{{dealer_date}}",
          "{{owner_date}}"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    }
  ]
}
